<title>UK: LIFFE coffee lower, cocoa off highs, sugar untrade.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee lower, cocoa off highs, sugar untrade.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Down but failed to make tipped opening fall. Sept $26</p>
<p>lower at $1,775 at 0939 GMT.</p>
<p>COCOA - Just off highs after opening firmer as expected. Sept 12</p>
<p>stg higher at 1,148.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Untraded so far.</p>
</text>
